{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Also</b> — the sense of אקבצם במצרים: then they begin to complain and to murmur a little, because of the heavy burden of the king of Egypt and Assyria and their officers. And it is not possible by way of grammar to interpret ויחלו as only, like וממקדשי תחלו."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:36.331490547Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}